{
  "_readme": "Deterministic candidate catalogue. Served by server/catalog/fixture.ts when CATALOG_SOURCE=fixture — never in production (the adapter refuses to start on Vercel). Documents are stored in the PROJECTED shape the GROQ queries in server/catalog/queries.ts return, so the real parse.ts pipeline runs over them unchanged. Prices are authored in EUROS exactly like the Studio; fromEuros converts once in parse.ts. GTINs are deliberately absent: assignment happens only inside the owner's licensed GS1 prefix (CLAUDE.md hard rule 3). The Merchant feed refuses to publish fewer than 5 offers, so this catalogue must always hold at least 5 sellable products. Inventory counts live at the bottom and are written to PostgreSQL by scripts/seed-candidate.mjs — Sanity-shaped documents never carry stock (queries.ts strips it on purpose).",
